<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Norwood Promotional.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Norwood Promotional.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw said analyst Barry Bryant has upgraded Norwood Promotional Products Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said in a report: &quot;We believe the worst of the earnings disappointments is now over and that the stock has bottomed.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set a 12-to-18 month price target of $20.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 3/8 to 13-7/8.</p>
